[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明还没找出凶手，却要投票……<br>　可是，我们也只能照做了）|#CommonBad01_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果没有找出凶手，就要全员处死。<br>即使，那个人并不是真正的凶手——|#CommonBad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也需要推选出这么一位人物，以【魔女】的身份接受处刑。|#CommonBad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Closed02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
[PrintTextModified Text:（可是，这实在是太难受了……）|#CommonBad01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不只是艾玛，<br>在场的所有人都脸色苍白地颤抖着。|#CommonBad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，投票时间无情地降临了。|#CommonBad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们各自按着自己的手机，<br>进行投票。|#CommonBad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后。|#CommonBad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

