[PrintTextModified Text:——欸？等、等一下……！<br>是不是搞错了什么……！？|#CommonBad01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
[PrintTextModified Text:呃，没搞错啊。<br>那么……<br>就决定对得票最多的樱羽艾玛实施刑罚咯！|#CommonBad01_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Lifeless01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open
[PrintTextModified Text:为、为什么！？<br>我说，为什么是我！？|#CommonBad01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛向梅露露投去无助的眼神。|#CommonBad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:而梅露露也露出一副难以置信的表情，<br>哑口无言。|#CommonBad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Lifeless01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open
[PrintTextModified Text:我说……为什么要投票选我！？|#CommonBad01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛向其他少女抛去疑问，<br>但没有任何人作出回答。|#CommonBad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有人尴尬地低下了头，<br>有人用怜悯的眼神望着艾玛。|#CommonBad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而真凶或许就在心中<br>悄悄窃笑着。|#CommonBad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.7
[PrintTextModified Text:理由不是怎样都好？<br>比如就是感觉很可疑……<br>又或者只是单纯的遭人讨厌……|#CommonBad01_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR12,ArmL16,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Fearful_Open03,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:这、这也太乱来了！<br>我根本没有杀人！！|#CommonBad01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.7
[PrintTextModified Text:哎，这已经是最终决定了。<br>虽然很遗憾，但只能请你接受这个结果了。<br>我想早点闭庭……能让我继续下一个环节了吗？|#CommonBad01_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管艾玛声泪俱下地哭诉自己的无辜，<br>但典狱长却不为所动。|#CommonBad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR1,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Lifeless01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:这太奇怪了！<br>大家也帮忙说句话啊！我说！！|#CommonBad01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
[PrintTextModified Text:啊，以防万一事先声明……<br>如果有人妨碍或者介入，<br>看守将对其同样定罪。|#CommonBad01_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
[PrintTextModified Text:大家只要按下手机上的处刑按钮，<br>就会开始执行处刑了。|#CommonBad01_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长就像是念稿子一样<br>平淡地作出宣告。|#CommonBad01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脸色煞白的少女们<br>各自按下了按钮。|#CommonBad01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

