[PrintTextModified Text:随着典狱长一声令下，<br>机关开始启动。|#CommonBad01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，从某处传来了齿轮的转动声，<br>中央的底座颤动了一下。|#CommonBad01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地板开了一个洞，底座缓缓地往下降。|#CommonBad01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，原本的底座消失不见，<br>一个新的底座出现了——|#CommonBad01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Lifeless01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Fearful_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Pale01>Pale01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:噫……断、断头台……？|#CommonBad01_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:这是切断骨头，斩落头颅的<br>行刑设备——|#CommonBad01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:锋利的刀刃发出寒光，<br>似乎在等待下一位囚犯的头颅。|#CommonBad01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛脸色煞白，全身颤抖起来。|#CommonBad01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长下达指示后，看守开始行动，<br>按住了艾玛。|#CommonBad01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Lifeless02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Pale01>Pale01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:不、不要！不要啊啊！<br>救命！放开我！|#CommonBad01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看守将挣扎着手脚的艾玛<br>拖上了舞台。|#CommonBad01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR11,ArmL15,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Cry_Closed02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Pale01>Pale01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:等、等一下！我真的，没有杀人！<br>这根本就不对！求你们住手！|#CommonBad01_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

