[PrintTextModified Text:看守按住无力抵抗着的艾玛的头部，<br>将其固定在断头台上。|#CommonBad01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因恐惧颤抖的艾玛，露出了绝望的神情。|#CommonBad01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守站在固定着砍刀的绳子旁，<br>缓缓举起了镰刀。|#CommonBad01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:死刑近在眼前。<br>艾玛陷入惊慌，呼吸十分慌乱。|#CommonBad01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【笨蛋】、【恶心】、【去死】——|#CommonBad01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:点缀在断头台上的无情涂鸦，<br>在艾玛看来就像是对她的指责。|#CommonBad01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要……不要……救命……|#CommonBad01_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:像呻吟般不断重复的艾玛的话语，<br>回响在审判庭之中。|#CommonBad01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在动手吧。<br>“唰”地一下就搞定～|#CommonBad01_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长对此情此景毫不在意，<br>直接向看守下达了指示。|#CommonBad01_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守对准绳子砍下了镰刀。|#CommonBad01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

